# Legacy Salesforce Redirects

The pages in this directory handle redirects from the old Salesforce-hosted
version of the Outline Help Center (support.getoutline.org/s/…).

The previous site used Salesforce Community URLs like:

- `/s/contactsupport`
- `/s/article/How-do-I-get-an-access-key`
- `/s/topic/…`

These redirects ensure that old bookmarks and external links still work after
the migration to Docusaurus.
